            <ArticleTitle>The anesthetic evaluation and management of the surgical patient with heart disease.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>1035-48</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Successful management of a patient with heart disease requires an understanding not only of the pharmacology of anesthesia but also of the pathophysiology of heart disease. Both of these factors as well as the choice and conduct of anesthesia by the anesthesiologist are thoroughly explored in this article.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
